flowchart LR
  A([Suspicious call<br/>or message]) --> B{Channel?}
  B -->|Phone call| C[Speakerphone →<br/>Live Call Guardian]
  B -->|SMS · WhatsApp · link<br/>screenshot · voice note| D[Scam Check]
  C --> E[Gemini 3.8 Live<br/>flags tactics in real time]
  E --> F{Risk ≥ 70?}
  F -->|no| E
  F -->|yes| G[Full-screen alert +<br/>spoken warning]
  D --> I[Triage · Evidence ·<br/>Community-intel agents]
  I --> J[Verdict · red flags ·<br/>kill-chain · sources]
  G --> H[One-tap hotline<br/>hang up · don't transfer]
  J --> H
  H --> K[(Redacted report<br/>Firestore)]
  K --> L[Campaign clustering<br/>vector search]
  L --> M[Bank / regulator console<br/>bulletins · Ask Intel]
  M --> N[Bank controls<br/>step-up · cooling-off · mule blocks]
